                    Process Bookings

                </h3>

                <p>

                    We use your information to create,
                    manage,
                    confirm,
                    and support your reservations and travel experiences.

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="use-card">

                <i class="fa-solid fa-user-shield"></i>

                <h3>

                    Account Security

                </h3>

                <p>

                    Your information helps us authenticate your identity,
                    protect your account,
                    and detect suspicious activity.

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="use-card">

                <i class="fa-solid fa-sliders"></i>

                <h3>

                    Personalization

                </h3>

                <p>

                    We remember your preferences,
                    favorite destinations,
                    and recently viewed listings to improve your experience.

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="use-card">

                <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line"></i>

                <h3>

                    Platform Improvement

                </h3>

                <p>

                    Anonymous usage information helps us improve search,
                    performance,
                    and overall platform usability.

                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>

    <!-- INFORMATION SHARING -->

    <section class="section" style="background:white;">

        <h2 class="section-title">

            When We Share Information

        </h2>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <div class="sharing-wrapper">

            <div>

                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1520607162513-77705c0f0d4a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80"
