                    Account authentication and password protection help safeguard access to your Homigo account.

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="security-card">

                <i class="fa-solid fa-server"></i>

                <h3>

                    Protected Infrastructure

                </h3>

                <p>

                    Our platform is designed with security best practices to reduce unauthorized access risks.

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="security-card">

                <i class="fa-solid fa-user-lock"></i>

                <h3>

                    Access Control

                </h3>

                <p>

                    Only authorized personnel have access to information required to provide platform services.

                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>

    <!-- DATA RETENTION -->

    <section class="section retention-section">

        <h2 class="section-title">

            Data Retention

        </h2>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <div class="retention-box">

            <div class="retention-icon">

                <i class="fa-solid fa-database"></i>

            </div>

            <div>

                <h3>

                    Keeping Information Only As Long As Necessary

                </h3>

                <p>

                    Homigo retains account and booking information only for as long as reasonably necessary to provide
                    services,
                    meet legal obligations,
                    resolve disputes,
                    or improve platform functionality.
                    When information is no longer required,
                    it is securely deleted or anonymized where appropriate.

                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>

    <!-- PRIVACY RIGHTS -->

    <section class="section">

        <h2 class="section-title">

            Your Privacy Rights

        </h2>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <div class="rights-grid">

            <div class="rights-card">

                <i class="fa-solid fa-eye"></i>

                <h3>

                    Access

                </h3>

                <p>

                    You may request access to the personal information associated with your Homigo account.

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="rights-card">

                <i class="fa-solid fa-pen-to-square"></i>

                <h3>

                    Correction

                </h3>

                <p>

                    You can update or correct your personal information whenever it becomes inaccurate.

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="rights-card">

                <i class="fa-solid fa-trash"></i>

                <h3>

                    Deletion

                </h3>

                <p>

                    You may request deletion of your account and personal information, subject to applicable legal
                    obligations.

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="rights-card">

                <i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i>

                <h3>

                    Data Portability

                </h3>

                <p>

                    Where applicable, you may request a copy of the information associated with your account.

                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>

    <!-- COOKIE USAGE -->

    <section class="section" style="background:white;">

        <h2 class="section-title">

            Cookies & Tracking Technologies

        </h2>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <div class="cookie-wrapper">

            <div>

                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516321318423-f06f85e504b3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80"
