                </p>

                <a href="/cookies" class="btn btn-primary mt-3">

                    View Cookie Policy

                </a>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>

    <!-- INTERNATIONAL DATA -->

    <section class="section">

        <h2 class="section-title">

            International Data Transfers

        </h2>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <div class="transfer-box">

            <div class="transfer-icon">

                <i class="fa-solid fa-earth-americas"></i>

            </div>

            <div>

                <h3>

                    Supporting Travelers Around the World

                </h3>

                <p>

                    If Homigo expands its services internationally,
