                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>

    <!-- LEGAL BASIS -->

    <section class="section legal-section">

        <h2 class="section-title">

            Why We Process Information

        </h2>

        <div class="divider"></div>

        <div class="legal-grid">

            <div class="legal-card">

                <i class="fa-solid fa-file-signature"></i>

                <h3>

                    Providing Services

                </h3>

                <p>

                    To create accounts,
                    process bookings,
                    and provide customer support.

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="legal-card">

                <i class="fa-solid fa-scale-balanced"></i>

                <h3>

                    Legal Compliance

                </h3>

                <p>

                    To comply with applicable laws,
                    regulations,
                    and legal obligations.

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="legal-card">

                <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-column"></i>

                <h3>

                    Platform Improvement

                </h3>

                <p>

                    To understand usage patterns
                    and improve platform functionality.

                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="legal-card">

                <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>

                <h3>

                    Security

                </h3>

                <p>

                    To protect users,
                    detect fraud,
                    and maintain platform integrity.

                </p>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>

    <!-- FAQ -->

    <section class="section faq-section">

        <div class="container">

            <h2 class="section-title">

                Frequently Asked Questions

            </h2>

            <div class="divider"></div>

            <div class="accordion" id="privacyFAQ">

                <div class="accordion-item">

                    <h2 class="accordion-header">

                        <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#privacy1">

                            Can I update my personal information?

                        </button>

                    </h2>

                    <div id="privacy1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#privacyFAQ">

                        <div class="accordion-body">

                            Yes. You can update your profile information from your account settings at any time to keep
                            your details accurate.

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item">

                    <h2 class="accordion-header">

                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#privacy2">

                            How do I delete my account?

                        </button>

                    </h2>

                    <div id="privacy2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#privacyFAQ">

                        <div class="accordion-body">

                            You may request account deletion through the Help Center or account settings. Certain
                            information may be retained where required by applicable laws.

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item">

                    <h2 class="accordion-header">

                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#privacy3">

                            Do you sell my personal information?

                        </button>

                    </h2>

                    <div id="privacy3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#privacyFAQ">

                        <div class="accordion-body">

                            No. Homigo does not sell personal information. Information is used only to provide services,
                            improve the platform, and comply with legal obligations.

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="accordion-item">

                    <h2 class="accordion-header">

                        <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                            data-bs-target="#privacy4">

                            Where can I learn more about cookies?

                        </button>

                    </h2>

                    <div id="privacy4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#privacyFAQ">

                        <div class="accordion-body">

                            Please visit our Cookie Policy page to learn how cookies and similar technologies are used
                            on Homigo.

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>

    <!-- POLICY UPDATES -->

    <section class="section" style="background:white;">

        <div class="container">

            <h2 class="section-title">

                Policy Updates

            </h2>

            <div class="divider"></div>

            <div class="update-box">

                <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate"></i>

                <div>

                    <h3>

                        Keeping You Informed

                    </h3>

                    <p>

                        This Privacy Policy may be updated periodically to reflect improvements to our platform, new
                        features, or changes in applicable regulations. Any significant changes will be communicated
                        through our website or other appropriate channels.

                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>

    <!-- LAST UPDATED -->

    <section class="section">

        <div class="container">

            <div class="last-updated">

                <h3>

                    <i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-days"></i>

                    Last Updated

                </h3>

                <p>

                    August 2026

